@page "/projects/formula-student-ai"
@using website.Data


<ProjectPage Url="/projects/formula-student-ai" Kicker="Personal Project · Leeds Formula Student AI team">
                <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                    I joined the simulation team of Leeds University's autonomous racing team, which builds a self-driving car for the international Formula Student AI competition. The simulation team built the environments used to test the car's autonomous subsystems.
                </p>
                <!-- Project Overview & Team Context -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Formula Student AI: The Competition" Icon="fas fa-flag-checkered">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Formula Student AI is a major international engineering competition in which university teams design, build and race self-driving formula-style cars. On top of the mechanical and electrical work of standard Formula Student, the car has to perceive the track, plan its path, control itself and make decisions in real time.</p>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Competition Challenges</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Dynamic events:</strong> acceleration, skidpad, autocross and endurance racing</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Static events:</strong> engineering design, cost analysis and business presentations</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Autonomy:</strong> the car has to drive itself the whole way</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Safety:</strong> it has to do so safely and reliably</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Leeds University FS-AI Team</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Work:</strong> developing an autonomous racing system</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Target:</strong> the international Formula Student AI competition</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Make-up:</strong> students from several engineering disciplines working together</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Aim:</strong> show the car can drive itself on track</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- My Role: Simulation & Exploration -->
                <ProjectSection Title="My Role: Simulation & Autonomous Systems Exploration" Icon="fas fa-user-cog">

                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line mb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                            <div class="bg-cy rounded-full w-2 h-2 mr-3"></div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Strategic Position</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                            I joined the simulation team because it touches every part of the car. Simulation sits between perception, planning, localization and control, so the role was a way to see how all of those subsystems fit together, even though my own work was on the simulation side.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-cyan-600/25">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Primary Responsibility: Simulation</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Proof of concept:</strong> show in simulation that the car could move and be controlled</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Integration testing:</strong> check that the subsystems worked together before going onto hardware</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Environment:</strong> simulation infrastructure built on ROS2</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Safer testing:</strong> try autonomous behaviour in simulation before real-world tests</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Broader Involvement Strategy</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Other subsystems:</strong> the role was meant to give me exposure to perception, planning and control</li>
                                <li>• <strong>The whole system:</strong> understanding how the parts fit together</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Learning:</strong> picking up the autonomous subsystems one at a time</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Teamwork:</strong> working alongside engineers from other disciplines</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">2024 Context: Building on Lessons Learned</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300">
                            Simulation mattered more than usual that year. At the previous competition the car had failed to move off the start line, so the team wanted to prove the autonomous systems worked in simulation before competition day.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Technical Stack & Infrastructure -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Technical Infrastructure" Icon="fas fa-server">

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Simulation Environment</h3>
                            <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <div><strong>Operating System:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS</div>
                                <div><strong>Framework:</strong> ROS2 (Robot Operating System 2)</div>
                                <div><strong>Languages:</strong> C++ and Python for ROS2 nodes and autonomous algorithms</div>
                                <div><strong>Containerization:</strong> Docker, so everyone had the same environment</div>
                                <div><strong>Purpose:</strong> proof-of-concept validation and subsystem integration testing</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Hardware Platform</h3>
                            <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <div><strong>Compute:</strong> Nvidia DGX Orin</div>
                                <div><strong>Capability:</strong> real-time autonomous decision making</div>
                                <div><strong>Performance:</strong> GPU-accelerated inference for perception</div>
                                <div><strong>Deployment:</strong> runs the autonomous systems on the vehicle</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Development Tools & Workflow</h3>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">ROS2 Ecosystem</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Modular nodes that pass messages to each other, spread across a distributed system.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Docker Containers</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Reproducible environments with managed dependencies, the same for everyone on the team.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Version Control</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Shared code, code review and tracking the project timeline.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Autonomous Vehicle Subsystems -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Autonomous Systems Components" Icon="fas fa-microchip">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">An autonomous racing car needs several subsystems working together in real time. The simulation work touched all of them:</p>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-eye mr-2"></i>Perception</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• Camera-based vision</li>
                                <li>• LiDAR point cloud processing</li>
                                <li>• Sensor fusion</li>
                                <li>• Object detection and tracking</li>
                                <li>• Track boundary recognition</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-route mr-2"></i>Planning & Control</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• Path planning</li>
                                <li>• Trajectory optimization</li>
                                <li>• Vehicle dynamics modeling</li>
                                <li>• Steering and throttle control</li>
                                <li>• Real-time decision making</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt mr-2"></i>Localization</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• SLAM (Simultaneous Localization and Mapping)</li>
                                <li>• GPS/IMU sensor integration</li>
                                <li>• Position estimation</li>
                                <li>• Map generation and tracking</li>
                                <li>• Real-time pose updates</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

